---
title: Sequence — Loan Approval with Reject Alternative
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as Express API
  participant ML as FastAPI ML
  participant DON as Chainlink DON
  participant SC as LoanController
  participant AP as Approver

  C->>FE: Submit USDC loan request
  FE->>API: POST /loans EIP-712 signed
  API->>SC: applyLoan — status SUBMITTED
  API->>ML: Assemble features + SHAP
  ML-->>API: risk score + explanation
  API->>DON: commit-reveal oracle request
  DON->>SC: SCORE_REVEALED on-chain
  API->>AP: Authority Brief

  alt Approve
    AP->>SC: approveLoan + allocateCapital
    SC-->>C: USDC disbursed
  else Reject
    AP->>SC: rejectLoan reason
    SC-->>C: rejected + logged reason
  end
